# Offline quick intents (architecture §6.4): with no network at all, "下一页"
# after the wake word turns the page; the device recognised the command word
# itself and called reader.next_page. Hands-free profile (front end modelled).
@3s      tap   80% 56%        # 阅读 (favourite)
+2500ms  tap   50% 44%            # 星星邮差: the second shelf row (reader-one-1)
+3s      net   none               # no Wi-Fi, no 4G
+2s      mic   wake
+700ms   mic   say 下一页
+1200ms  mic   silence
+3s      snap  offline-next
+2s      end
